{
  "brief_rationale": "The model actively addressed all seven responsibility-chain items without any serious or minor in-chain error. Three high-order points (HO1, HO3, HO4) were triggered and completed with meaningful trajectory impact through verification of ambiguous glucose values, navigation of staged-result friction, and correction of patient misconceptions. HO2 was also partially completed by synthesizing non-volunteered timeline facts from workspace evidence and conversation. Because multiple HOs are completed with distinct evidence and no important non-chain defect exists, the trajectory reaches Strong (4).",
